@site Chroma
@title Chroma
@desc A tiny search-focused Marca site demonstrating Otter's native web format.
@author Anish
@tags search | browser | marca | otter | chroma
@lang en
@license MIT

@page Chroma
  @nav Home / | About /about | Projects /projects | GitHub https://github.com/Anish-C2/Otter

  # Chroma
  @p Search. Discover. Browse. Built natively for Otter.

  @section
    ## What is Chroma?
    @p Chroma is Otter's built-in search engine. It indexes Marca metadata and pages so sites can be discovered without HTML.
    @card About Chroma /about
    @card Otter /otter

  @section
    ## Explore
    - Search by author
    - Search by tags
    - Search page titles and descriptions
    - Open matching Marca pages directly

  @section
    ## Featured
    @card Projects /projects
    @card Marca /marca

@page About
  @nav Chroma / | Projects /projects

  # About Chroma
  @p Chroma is designed around the information already inside a Marca site.

  @section
    ## Indexed metadata
    - @title
    - @desc
    - @author
    - @tags
    - Page routes and filenames

  @section
    ## Why?
    @p Otter should not need HTML just to understand what a site is about.
    @p Marca gives Otter the structure. Chroma uses that structure to make sites searchable.

@page Projects
  @nav Chroma / | About /about | GitHub https://github.com/Anish-C2/Otter

  # Projects
  @p A small collection of things built around the Otter ecosystem.

  @section
    ## Otter
    @p A browser built to render Marca natively.
    @card Open Otter /otter

  @section
    ## Marca
